# =============================================================================
# DWN Lead Engine — Wrangler local secrets template
# =============================================================================
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` for local development. `.dev.vars` is gitignored.
# For production, use `wrangler secret put <KEY>` instead — never commit real
# secrets.
#
# All of these are OPTIONAL. The app runs in demo mode without any of them.
# =============================================================================

# --- Google Places API (optional, Phase 6) ------------------------------------
# Server-side only. Required to enable the Google Places discovery adapter.
# Create at https://console.cloud.google.com/ with Places API enabled and
# billing linked. Field masks + quotas enforced in src/lib/sources/google-places.ts.
# GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# --- AI provider (optional, Phase 7) ------------------------------------------
# Server-side only. Enables AI-assisted opportunity briefs and outreach drafts.
# If unset, the app falls back to deterministic templates.
# AI_PROVIDER=anthropic
# AI_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- PageSpeed Insights (optional, Phase 4) -----------------------------------
# Server-side only. Enables real-user-ish perf metrics in the website audit.
# Baseline audit works without this using the bounded HTML fetcher.
# PAGESPEED_API_KEY=

# --- Scheduled jobs (optional, future) ----------------------------------------
# Shared secret for authenticating Cron Trigger invocations when cron endpoints
# are introduced. Not used in Phase 0.
# CRON_SECRET=
